th controls, dynamic arenas, and an energetic community, Project Moose V3 delivers endless replayability. Will you outsmart your friends and prove yourself as the ultimate player, or will you get caught slipping?\n\nGet ready to move fast, play hard, and charge like a moose.", "short_description": "Project Moose V3 is a fast-paced multiplayer VR experience where players tag, dodge, and outmaneuver opponents in dynamic arenas. Use speed, strategy, and precision to become the ultimate Moose in this action-packed virtual playground."}]}, "developer_name": "shiny", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/projectmoosev3/private-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ProjectMooseStudios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/projectmoosev3/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "24911898521770710"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619672_1711007109594947_1478344578681765516_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qMCnQrwRI_AQ7kNvwFqiQYL&_nc_oc=AdrniV_MatgFYhk32LbqGmQCtuV9y6w5yWqZJ6XGL1xmJKbZTdbjpGmatptzycFzCYk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQqO-QGle8ecPA2gKK-z1Z8qu21facKPXTJ3wgDFN6Wsw&oe=6B05AB13"}, "is_concept": 